Changes: package-relative imports, local-only component loading, automatic
PyTorch attention dispatch, and an FP8 GEMM compatibility path that applies
rowwise scaling after scalar-scaled FP8 matrix multiplication.

Model weights are excluded and remain subject to their separate licenses.

Additional source adaptations include bounded FP8 row buffers, full-spatial
streamed VAE normalization/convolutions/upsampling/residual projections, and
extension-owned hooks to Forge attention and Spectrum feature forecasting.

Spectrum algorithm reference: https://github.com/hanjq17/Spectrum
